1105
01:22:36,869 --> 01:22:38,462
<i>Muchacho depravado.</i>

1106
01:22:40,122 --> 01:22:42,466
<i>Eres uno de los afortunados,
créeme.</i>

1107
01:22:42,624 --> 01:22:46,299
<i>El método de Jeremy
