1166
01:35:14,167 --> 01:35:15,669
Échatelo, abuelo.

1167
01:35:33,269 --> 01:35:34,646
¡Maldito seas!

1168
01:35:54,165 --> 01:35:55,587
Déjame a mí.

1169
01:37:06,529 --> 01:37:07,530
Chris...

1170
