Perdóname.

1171
01:37:11,451 --> 01:37:12,794
Soy yo.

1172
01:37:15,204 --> 01:37:18,424
Te quiero.

1173
01:37:19,917 --> 01:37:21,590
Te quiero.

1174
01:38:10,134 --> 01:38:12,228
Auxilio. Auxilio.

1175
01:38:13,554 --> 01:38:16,057
Auxilio. Ayúdenme.

1176
01:38:19,143 --> 01:38:21,111
AEROPUERTO

1177
